---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 19, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Amplo Consulting"
  description="How Amplo Consulting collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl legal-doc">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--color-gold)]">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)] leading-[1.08]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p class="mt-10">
        Amplo Consulting, LLC ("<strong>Amplo</strong>," "<strong>we</strong>,"
        "<strong>us</strong>," or "<strong>our</strong>") respects your
        privacy. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and
        safeguard information when you visit
        <a href="https://amploconsulting.com">amploconsulting.com</a>
        (the "<strong>Site</strong>") or interact with us through it. By
        using the Site, you agree to the practices described below.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you provide</h3>
      <p>
        When you submit the contact form on the Site, we collect the
        information you choose to send us, which may include your name,
        email address, mobile phone number, and the contents of your
        message.
      </p>
      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>
        When you visit the Site, our hosting provider and our analytics
        infrastructure may automatically log basic technical information,
        such as your IP address, browser type, device type, referring
        page, pages you view, and the date and time of your visit. We use
        this information to operate, secure, and improve the Site.
      </p>
      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        The Site uses a small number of strictly necessary cookies,
        including a session cookie set when an authorized administrator
        signs in to the internal admin area. We do not currently use
        third-party advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>respond to inquiries you send us through the contact form;</li>
        <li>contact you about engagements, proposals, and follow-ups;</li>
        <li>operate, maintain, and secure the Site;</li>
        <li>comply with our legal, regulatory, and professional obligations; and</li>
        <li>improve the content and structure of the Site over time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Share Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with
        service providers that help us operate the Site and the lead
        intake process, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google LLC</strong> — for storing contact form submissions in Google Sheets and for administrator authentication via Google Sign-In;</li>
        <li><strong>Resend, Inc.</strong> — for delivering transactional email notifications to our team; and</li>
        <li><strong>Vercel, Inc.</strong> — for hosting and serving the Site.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We may also disclose information when required by law, to enforce
        our Terms of Service, or to protect the rights, property, or
        safety of Amplo, our clients, or others.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain information submitted through the contact form for as
        long as reasonably necessary to respond to your inquiry, manage
        any resulting engagement, and meet our recordkeeping obligations.
        You may request that we delete information about you at any
        time, subject to limited exceptions described below.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you reside, you may have rights to access,
        correct, delete, or restrict the use of your personal information,
        and to object to certain processing. Residents of California
        (CCPA/CPRA), the European Economic Area (GDPR), the United
        Kingdom (UK GDPR), and other jurisdictions with comparable laws
        may have additional rights. To exercise any of these rights,
        contact us using the information at the end of this Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable administrative, technical, and physical
        safeguards to protect the information we collect. No method of
        electronic transmission or storage is completely secure, however,
        and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is intended for business audiences and is not directed
        to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect
        information from children. If you believe a child has submitted
        information to us, please contact us so we can delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>8. International Visitors</h2>
      <p>
        Amplo is based in Miami, Florida, in the United States. If you
        access the Site from outside the United States, please understand
        that information you submit will be transferred to and processed
        in the United States, where data protection laws may differ from
        those in your jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do,
        we will revise the "Last updated" date above. Material changes
        will be highlighted on the Site for a reasonable period after
        they take effect.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or about how we
        handle your information, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:info@amploconsulting.com">info@amploconsulting.com</a>
        or by mail at:
      </p>
      <p>
        Amplo Consulting, LLC<br />
        Miami, Florida<br />
        United States
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .legal-doc h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-doc h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-doc p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-doc ul {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    list-style: disc;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-doc ul li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-doc a {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-gold) 60%, transparent);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }
  .legal-doc a:hover {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }
  .legal-doc strong {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
